{:edb/db-before-t 2095 :edb/db-after-t 2096 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535408 50 #inst "2026-10-08T23:31:47.737Z" 13194139535408 true] [17592186096757 1020 #edb/ref 17592186347721 13194139535408 true] [17592186096757 1020 #edb/ref 17592186347728 13194139535408 true] [17592186096758 1020 #edb/ref 17592186347735 13194139535408 true] [17592186096758 1020 #edb/ref 17592186347746 13194139535408 true] [17592186096759 1020 #edb/ref 17592186347741 13194139535408 true] [17592186347721 1017 #edb/ref 17592186347722 13194139535408 true] [17592186347721 1089 "q-123435" 13194139535408 true] [17592186347721 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535408 true] [17592186347721 1100 "Find $\\int ⟨{e}^{t+1},\\,12\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3t)⟩\\,\\text{d}t.$" 13194139535408 true] [17592186347721 1113 #uuid "ae9740d6-44f0-50b4-8094-5aec220611bd" 13194139535408 true] [17592186347721 1145 "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨{e}^{t+1},\\,12\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3t)⟩\\text{d}t=⟨\\int {e}^{t+1}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int 12\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3t)\\,\\text{d}t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $x(t)={e}^{t+1},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int {e}^{t+1}\\text{d}t={e}^{t+1}+{c}_{1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $y(t)=12\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3t),$ we calculate its integral using substitution. So, we let $u=3t.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}t}=3\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}t=\\frac{1}{3}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,  we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int y(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =\\int 12\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\int 12\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{12}{3}\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =4(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡u)+{c}_{2} \\\\  & =-4\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t)+{c}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨{e}^{t+1},\\,12\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3t)⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨{e}^{t+1}+{c}_{1},\\,-4\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t)+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{e}^{t+1},\\,-4\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t)⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{e}^{t+1},\\,-4\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t)⟩+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535408 true] [17592186347722 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347723 13194139535408 true] [17592186347722 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347724 13194139535408 true] [17592186347722 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347725 13194139535408 true] [17592186347722 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347726 13194139535408 true] [17592186347722 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347727 13194139535408 true] [17592186347722 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535408 true] [17592186347722 1041 "selection" 13194139535408 true] [17592186347722 1104 #edb/ref 17592186347723 13194139535408 true] [17592186347722 1110 #uuid "748165c9-e9ef-5229-8cc7-2d5dc972ce8c" 13194139535408 true] [17592186347723 1034 "⟨{e}^{t+1},\\,-4\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t)⟩+C" 13194139535408 true] [17592186347723 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535408 true] [17592186347723 1111 #uuid "21d81a6a-c181-537d-a961-fa8020325bc5" 13194139535408 true] [17592186347724 1034 "⟨{e}^{3t},\\,3\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t)⟩+C" 13194139535408 true] [17592186347724 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535408 true] [17592186347724 1111 #uuid "4aeedef3-75c1-5ba0-b55f-0580f364c910" 13194139535408 true] [17592186347725 1034 "⟨{e}^{t+1},\\,4\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t)⟩+C" 13194139535408 true] [17592186347725 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535408 true] [17592186347725 1111 #uuid "302d4f57-97ec-54bb-b2e7-cb1539f6f5f4" 13194139535408 true] [17592186347726 1034 "⟨{e}^{t-1},\\,-4\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t)⟩+C" 13194139535408 true] [17592186347726 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535408 true] [17592186347726 1111 #uuid "e3aa1818-e4e7-5c6f-97c0-c202791b7d7a" 13194139535408 true] [17592186347727 1034 "⟨{e}^{t},\\,-4\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C" 13194139535408 true] [17592186347727 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535408 true] [17592186347727 1111 #uuid "643d4235-fe2a-5067-8e7c-c1c81d3bc507" 13194139535408 true] [17592186347728 1017 #edb/ref 17592186347729 13194139535408 true] [17592186347728 1089 "q-123438" 13194139535408 true] [17592186347728 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535408 true] [17592186347728 1100 "Find $\\int ⟨2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{t}{4}),\\,{e}^{t-1}⟩\\,\\text{d}t.$" 13194139535408 true] [17592186347728 1113 #uuid "53bd3a98-c5a9-50e2-9a0c-9c6d9fc4a3f4" 13194139535408 true] [17592186347728 1145 "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{t}{4}),\\,{e}^{t-1}⟩\\text{d}t=⟨\\int 2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{t}{4})\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int {e}^{t-1}\\,\\text{d}t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $x(t)=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{t}{4}),$ we calculate its integral using substitution. So, we let $u=\\frac{t}{4}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}t}=\\frac{1}{4}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}t=4\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,  we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =\\int 2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{t}{4})\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\int 2\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\cdot 4\\text{d}u \\\\  & =8\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =8(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡u)+{c}_{1} \\\\  & =-8\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{t}{4})+{c}_{1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $y(t)={e}^{t-1},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int y(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int {e}^{t-1}\\text{d}t={e}^{t-1}+{c}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{t}{4}),\\,{e}^{t-1}⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨-8\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{t}{4})+{c}_{1},\\,{e}^{t-1}+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-8\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{t}{4}),\\,{e}^{t-1}⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-8\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{t}{4}),\\,{e}^{t-1}⟩+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535408 true] [17592186347729 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347730 13194139535408 true] [17592186347729 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347731 13194139535408 true] [17592186347729 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347732 13194139535408 true] [17592186347729 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347733 13194139535408 true] [17592